      "writtenOn": "2022-08-22T20:54:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "i\u0027m not convinced mixing data types here helps specify the data format\nclearly to the reader.\nideally they should all be uint32_t with the appropriate width bit\nfield. i think you\u0027re lucky here that the bit fields fit nicely into\nbytes. if that weren\u0027t the case, i think this style of declaration\nwould inadvertently lead to bit padding.",
